      "writtenOn": "2022-02-16T09:11:37Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think this should just be called unregister(timeout) or unregisterWithTimeout(timeout) or unregisterPendingReplacement(timeout). After all that\u0027s what it does ; once this has been called the network will be reaped after the timeout.\n\nYou\u0027d then be able to implement unregister() as a call to unregister(0) and simplify the code.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 983,
        "startChar": 16,
        "endLine": 983,
        "endChar": 40
      },
      "revId": "db1d5e682cc353a2b1f6de7cb053a42d7d8d5fda",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
