      "writtenOn": "2022-02-16T09:11:37Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Though it\u0027s reasonable to say this network can no longer update Score, NC and likely also LP (I took a quick look and think it\u0027s fine but we\u0027d have to check in detail), I think some of the events will still need to be handled. In particular stopping keepalive might be necessary because it releases hardware resources that a client would need to reuse before the max 5s delay of this API is over.",
      "range": {
